d/msg/lojban/vMQ-GQsAJEA/Lbxj4agFykcJ';return true;">declaration of the bas=
eline</a>, announced January 10, 1997, and headlined, "THE LOGLAN/LOJBAN LA=
NGUAGE DESIGN is considered COMPLETE".</p>
<p>Unfortunately, this triumph was soon undone. The fine print made a subtl=
e but enormously consequential distinction between the "design" of the lang=
uage and what was called the "definition". The design was said to be comple=
te, but without a "baseline description document" for the lexicon -- the gi=
