dictionary -- recognition of the baseline "language definition" was suspend=
ed for six months. At the <a href=3D"http://www.lojban.org/tiki/LLG+1997+An=
nual+Meeting+Minutes" target=3D"_blank" onmousedown=3D"this.href=3D'http://=
